### Get all types

GET http://localhost:5000/api/types
Content-Type: application/json


### Get all types with pagination

GET http://localhost:5000/api/types?limit=3&page=2
Content-Type: application/json


### Get type by Id

GET http://localhost:5000/api/types/65f000000000000000000003
Content-Type: application/json


### Create type

POST http://localhost:5000/api/types
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "воздушние"
}

### Update type

PUT http://localhost:5000/api/types
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "_id": "6aeea4aa92e72ada67e58641",
  "name": "полувоздушниеT"
}

### Delete type with id

DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/types/6aeea59192e72ada67e58644
Content-Type: application/json
